sequenceDiagram
    actor HostUser as Host user
    participant Host as whip-pair
    participant Whip as Whip client
    participant Keys as authorized_keys

    Host->>Host: Select interface and bind TCP listener
    Host->>Host: Generate token and ephemeral TLS certificate
    Host-->>HostUser: Display WP3 QR code
    HostUser-->>Whip: Scan QR code
    Whip->>Whip: Decode endpoint, token, and certificate pin
    Whip->>Host: Connect with TLS and verify pinned certificate SHA-256
    Whip->>Host: PairingHello { token }
    Host->>Host: Check token and server-side expiry
    Host-->>Whip: PairingServerInfo { SSH host, port, user, host-key fingerprint }
    Whip->>Host: EnrollmentRequest { device name, Ed25519 public key }
    Host->>Host: Validate key and calculate fingerprint
    Host-->>HostUser: Show device and key fingerprint and request approval
    alt approved
        Host->>Keys: Append key safely and idempotently
        Host-->>Whip: approved { fingerprint, already_present }
        Host->>Host: Stop pairing server
    else rejected or invalid
        Host-->>Whip: error { code, message }
        Host->>Host: Continue until success or expiry
    end
